    "body": "<!-- agent-note:v1 -->\nstate: done\ntask: 17283\nlane: code-c\nworker: repo-worker-code\n\nPR #7860 is MERGED. Merge commit ef1f6b7a44d1174cddfdc896b551d6f7c2f70359 (2026-11-14T22:16:01Z).\n\nWhat was done this shift: rebased the branch onto current main in laptop worktree ~/git/fleet/queue-17283-7860 (README index conflicts union-resolved; head 077b882c9b41de3ea4599f04ffc67e3c3f4b4c85). The one Codex P2 finding was fixed in the record itself and dispositioned on its thread (reply 4575871880): a committed waiver naming the exact head SHA invalidated itself, so the waiver now binds to the tested commit, waiver-only commits preserve validity, any other post-approval change invalidates it, and approver acceptance is also recorded outside the tested tree. Clean merge against latest main verified with git merge-tree (exit 0) and GitHub mergeable=true immediately before merging; no failing/pending checks attributable to this docs-only change (the old head's scripts-test / fleet-search parity failures are pre-existing and unrelated).\n\nIssue #5897 stays open: this PR is its decision record; implementation and CI tiering are follow-on work per the record.\n",
